# L §2.3 Calls (round 14): a band's id "with the prefixes that name the band outside ... its member ...: a.b(x) for
# a member's (§6.1)". The joint model calls a.fee on ana's income: fee's one row gives 2.00 PLN.
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "0be31b307ddcd6ba412fafbc28878f79fe7de5497920df56399f1ee7c56265b0"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "62b0623690f8004e28037173884be55e87162cbbd244eb89cae891e9e3867ce4"

ask f: a.fee(a.income[a.ana]) law 2026-06-30
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
place wsp: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
input income[p in persons]: money PLN
band fee(x: money PLN): money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  persons + [ana, ola] lives 2000-01-01..
  income[ana] = 100.00 PLN "umowa"
  income[ola] = 10.00 PLN "umowa"
  opening[wsp] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  fee: [0 PLN, inf) = 2.00 PLN "cennik"
=== ben.tally
model ben
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
place wsp: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
input pocket[p in persons]: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  persons + [ben, ola_k] lives 2000-01-01..
  pocket[ben] = 50.00 PLN "umowa"
  pocket[ola_k] = 5.00 PLN "umowa"
  opening[wsp] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== expect
f: 2.00 PLN
...
